From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: H96 build <builder@h96-build>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/59] arm64: dts: rockchip: add H96 Max V58 board

Board DTS for this tree's RK3588 layout. Base is
rk3588-nvr-demo-v10-android.dts, the board the box's vendor DTB is
built from. Board content follows the H96 8.0 DTB (vendor DTB plus
h96-max-v58.dtso overlay):

- GPU: Panthor binding on the vendor gpu node (device stays
  fb000000.gpu), CRU core clock, 300 to 1000 MHz table, gpu-supply on
  the power controller, NPLL 4 GHz.
- cursor-win-id 0 on VP0; watchdog on; cpu-sleep idle state on; 408 to
  1008 MHz CPU points for the standard RK3588 bin (opp-supported-hw
  0xe9, same mask as this tree's 1200 MHz and up points).
- WiFi on pcie2x1l0 with reset gpio and wl_reg_on hog, SDIO off,
  wlan/bluetooth platform nodes, uart9 without DMA.
- HDMI0 CEC, i2c-gpio DDC bus (alias i2c10), I2S5 hdmi-path, HDMI
  sound cards as simple-audio-card with the 8.0 card names, S/PDIF tx0.
- RTC interrupt and 32 kHz clock output, gmac1 reset gpio, USB3 OTG0
  host mode, work LED, vendor remote key tables, AV1 decoder.
- es8311, i2s0 sound, gmac0, csi2 dphy, mipi dcphy, DP1, i2c5, vepu
  and fiq-debugger off as in the 8.0 DTB.

H96 series: 6.12 port of tvboox dtb-overlay/src/h96-max-v58.dtso and
the board nodes of the vendor DTB.
